    "updated_at": "2018-04-04T04:45:43Z",
    "body": "Okay, I am working on this issue.\r\n\r\nI wrote https://github.com/singular-value/OpenFermion/commit/df496de3dc33b145bab2af5056fdeb7596b42d56, which updates `__eq__`. In order to allow allow comparisons between `PolynomialTensor`s with different keys, I needed to convert the keys to sets. This also happened to take care of the ordering-sensitivity, so I didn't end up needing to import dict from builtins.\r\n\r\nWill make the pull request when I also update `__add__`, `__sub__`, and `__mul__` later this week.",
