    "body": "@kevinsung and @idk3, quick clarification question. Did you resolve in #240 that:\r\n\r\n- Attempting to add, subtract, and multiply `PolynomialTensor`s of differing keys should always raise a `ValueError` (instead of the current `TypeError`)\r\nOR that\r\n- Attempting to add, subtract, and multiply `PolynomialTensor`s of differing keys should be permissible iff the differing keys correspond to zero-arrays. If the differing keys correspond to non-zero arrays then we should raise a `ValueError`.\r\nOR that\r\n- Attempting to add, subtract, and multiply `PolynomialTensor`s of differing keys should always be permitted. Differing keys should be incorporated into the result.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
